dpoint, $500 million related to China on the sales line, and that correlated to our total company guide of 1% to 2%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GEHC 2024 Q4","e":"gehc","d":"2025-02-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Peter Arduini","x":"This guide is in line with our current view of the China market and the U.S. tariffs on products from China.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GEHC 2024 Q4","e":"gehc","d":"2025-02-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jay Saccaro","x":"While the U.S. tariff dynamic is fluid, we have incorporated the new China tariffs, which are in place today into our 2025 guidance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GEHC 2024 Q4","e":"gehc","d":"2025-02-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jay Saccaro","x":"We've also filed through pass-through, we would expect to have that not too far off of that date, but we'll see when that comes in.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q1","e":"gehc","d":"2025-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jay Saccaro","x":"…to patient care solutions on slide nine, organic revenue growth was up 2% versus the prior year, driven by continued growth with improved backlog execution in monitoring solutions in the U.S. EBIT margin declined 450 basis points year-over-year, due to investments, tariff impact, and product mix.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q1","e":"gehc","d":"2025-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jay Saccaro","x":"We're actively working inventory cycle times and strategically managing our inventory amid the current tariff environment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q1","e":"gehc","d":"2025-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jay Saccaro","x":"Our PDX business has positive pricing dynamics, so we'll have to watch that.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q1","e":"gehc","d":"2025-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Arduini","x":"I'm excited to share that we received CMS pass-through pricing for this novel tracer, and we're on track with our planned rollout.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q1","e":"gehc","d":"2025-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Bednar","x":"You already had cost saving efforts in motion for this year and obviously planned for future years?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q1","e":"gehc","d":"2025-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Bednar","x":"And then for my follow-up, a lot of other changes implemented by the current administration beyond just tariffs, including budget cuts and headcount reductions of key healthcare agencies.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q2","e":"gehc","d":"2025-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"James K. Saccaro","x":"Organic revenue was up 2% year-over-year with continued strong performance in the U.S. as customers invest in AI-enhanced ultrasound solutions across multiple care settings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/ge-healthcare-gehc-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q2","e":"gehc","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James K. Saccaro","x":"Adjusted EBIT margin in the quarter was 14.6%, down 80 basis points year-over-year due to tariff impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/ge-healthcare-gehc-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q2","e":"gehc","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James K. Saccaro","x":"This included approximately $0.08 of impact from tariffs.","url":"http