,"l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Peter J. Arduini","x":"As we continue to navigate a dynamic global environment, our teams remain agile and focused on operational improvements and actions to reduce tariff impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/ge-healthcare-gehc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q3","e":"gehc","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Peter J. Arduini","x":"We've mitigated approximately 50% of our 2025 gross exposure, and we're on track with our goal of delivering a lower net tariff impact in 2026 versus 2025, based on currently enacted tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/ge-healthcare-gehc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q3","e":"gehc","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Peter J. Arduini","x":"These include sourcing from lower-cost regions, developing second sources, implementing value engineering initiatives, executing targeted site transfers, and achieving price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/ge-healthcare-gehc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q3","e":"gehc","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Justin Marcus","x":"Maybe you could just give us a little more on what GE HealthCare Technologies Inc. can do to help streamline the workflow conversion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/ge-healthcare-gehc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q4","e":"gehc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Peter Arduini","x":"We delivered strong bottom-line and cash performance in the fourth quarter, excluding tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/ge-healthcare-gehc-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GEHC 2025 Q4","e":"gehc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jay Saccaro","x":"Margin was negatively impacted by approximately $100 million 